# Bearer of Glory: "{4}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn." Plains and Mox Pearl alone are short, so the
# activation is refused; adding Black Lotus (white) pays exactly and leaves the pool empty. Bot1's Bearer (2/1) becomes 3/2 and its
# Ornithopter 1/3; Bot2's Ornithopter stays 0/2 ("you control"). On turn 5 the effect is over.

